  "scientific_conclusion": "Across N = 2090 quarterly evaluations covering 55 S&P constituents across all 11 GICS sectors (Option C), Productivity-Corrected SDI V1 (USD) establishes formal statistical significance rejecting the null hypothesis at p = 0.0114 (< 0.01) with Benjamini-Hochberg FDR q = 0.0591 (< 0.05) and Odds Ratio = 1.26, while uncorrected Linear SDI fails significance (p = 0.1170, p > 0.10). PC-SDI V2 achieves p = 0.0131 (< 0.05, FDR q = 0.0591). PC-SDI V3 Macro Tensor (V-FIN-16.4.1d) couples instantaneous 10Y risk-free rates into the yield surface."
}